{"metadata":{"title":"textVariableAnchor","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"textVariableAnchor"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"textVariableAnchor"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNSymbolStyleLayer(py)textVariableAnchor"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"To increase the chance of placing high-priority labels on the map, you can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provide an array of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"textAnchor"},{"type":"text","text":" locations: the renderer will attempt to place"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the label at each location, in order, before moving onto the next label. Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"textJustify: auto"},{"text":" to choose justification based on anchor position. To apply","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an offset, use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"textRadialOffset","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or the two-dimensional ","type":"text"},{"code":"textOffset","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSExpression","text":"NSExpression","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"textVariableAnchor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"tex